abstract: >-
  Article-specific reproducibility package for the published PLOS ONE article
  (DOI 10.1371/journal.pone.0350967; historical manuscript ID PONE-D-26-13579R2),
  including submission files, figures, derived data, veterinary-exclusion audit
  artifacts, statements, and minimal reproduction scripts. Corrected closed
  cohort: 161,830 pharmaceutical contracts (2020-2025).
